WEBVTT

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.960
Humanity was suddenly reminded that day.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:27.300
Of the terror of being at their mercy...

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.680
Of the humiliation of being
trapped inside a cage...

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.810
Eren...

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:39.390
Eren!

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.350
Eren, wake up.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.650
Mikasa?

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.150
You need to get up.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:51.740
It... It feels like I had this
<i>really</i> long dream or something...

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.410
What was it about?

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.160
I can't remember...

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.240
Eren...

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.490
Hm?

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.990
You're drooling.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.120
And, we'll be late.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.080
Ahhhh!

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:03.870
See you later!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.170
Okay, have a good day.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.880
Hurry up, Eren.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.920
See you later, Mom!

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.680
Have a good day.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.650
Crap! I don't wanna be late on
my very first day of junior high!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:51.980
Period 1
Starting School! Titan Junior High School

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:56.610
Hey, Mikasa! Don't you dare tell anyone
I was drooling while I was asleep!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.030
I won't tell anyone...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.280
...that you put your pants on backwards.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.330
Argh! Stop it!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.080
Eren! Watch where you're going!

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.660
Eren!

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:12.880
I'm sorry. I was in a hurry.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:15.960
That's okay. I was in a hurry, too, so...

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.260
Ah... My breakfast!

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.090
Hey, hey, hey! What the hell
kinda plot are you tryin' to pull

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:25.060
by bumping into my precious Christa
while she had toast in her mouth?!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:26.520
Plot...

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.480
Are you okay, Christa?

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.150
Marry me once the entrance ceremony is over.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.440
Sorry. Buy something else to eat with this!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:37.190
- I told ya to keep your damn hands off her!
- Well then, I'm in a hurry, so...!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.030
Don't ever show your face again!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.820
Ten yen...

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.830
We'd better hurry up!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:49.460
Ahhhhhh! My watermelon!

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.880
- Eating watermelon in the morning?
- Sorry! I'm in a hurry, so...!

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.250
I'm going to drive them out

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.130
Pay for my watermelon!

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.010
Dammit! I'm not gonna run into anyo—

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.010
Ow, ow...

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.720
We'd better hurry up.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.020
Wait, Eren!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:13.190
Dammit... Just how far away is this school?!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.860
I want to...

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.780
...devise a plot to bump into Eren, too.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.030
Ow, ow...

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.740
Are you okay?

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.870
Eren...

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.660
Y-Yeah.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:44.510
♪ Coo, coo, coo. The pigeon says coo. ♪

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.760
♪ Do you— ♪

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.270
Eren...

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.610
Eren, wait for me!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.110
Huh?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:08.030
Ow, ow, ow...

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.080
- Eren!
- You son of a bitch!

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.580
Ymir! Wait for me!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.670
My watermelon!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.210
What in the world just happened?

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:17.710
So, this is...

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.130
...Attack Junior High School!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.760
"Junior High"

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.800
It's huge!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.220
"Junior High"

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:28.260
Oh, shoot! We're late!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.260
Wait, Eren!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.770
Oh no!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.690
My watermelon!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:41.860
That way!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.650
Please wait!

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.570
<b>Humans
Titans</b>

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.700
<b>Titans
Humans</b>

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.950
<b>Empty Cans</b>

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.120
Wha...?!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.420
It's huge!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.960
It looks kinda creepy.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.000
Oh, shoot!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.010
<b>Empty Cans</b>

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.810
Hey...

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.890
Don't you think... something's odd?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.430
Just what do you think is odd?!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.350
Huh?! Does this look perfectly normal to you?!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.230
Ah, there it is!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:17.690
Year 1, Class 4

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.070
Year 1, class 4! It's over there!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.820
Hey...

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:25.900
I have no idea how to open this door.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.820
- But it's not just 'cause I'm stupid, right?
- Just be quiet, you idiot.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.370
Look...

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.750
Whoa!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.500
No one's here.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.340
Don't you think something's strange?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.010
Just what do you think is stran—

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.670
Eren!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.840
A-An eraser?

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:49.760
Are you okay?

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:50.050
"Eren"

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.510
I'm gonna make a stamp out of it!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:51.720
"Eren"

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:52.640
Stop it.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.850
- That stamp will be backwards, right?
- Calm down, Eren. Something <i>really</i> is strange.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.810
- Yep, yep.
- Like I said, just what is stran—

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:04.570
Ahh! Ahh! Ow! Ow! Owwwwwww!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.120
Huh?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.870
A-A Titan?!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.000
Titans...

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.710
A Titan took something precious away from me!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.720
Eren
A Titan took something precious away from me!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.930
I'm going to drive you all out! Every las—

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.560
Wh-Wh-What's going on?!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.770
We wandered into one of the Titans' classrooms!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.410
You brats!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.830
What're you guys doing?!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.080
Mr. Hannes!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.000
- That sure was a disaster, huh?
- That damn Titan!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.000
It's not funny.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.840
Sorry. That's the Titans' school building.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.220
Your school building is this one.

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:13.260
Whoa...!

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.470
Welcome to Attack Junior High School!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.020
I-It's normal.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.140
Year 1           Class 4

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.600
Attention!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:21.810
<b>Welcome to
Attack Junior
High! By Keith</b>

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:27.940
Homeroom for Attack Junior High's
104th Year 1, Class 4 begins now!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.570
You have the misfortune
of having me, Keith Sadies,

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.240
as your homeroom teacher!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.120
I do <i>not</i> welcome you warmly!

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.290
In your current state, you'd be
nothing but food for the Titans!

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.830
You're mere livestock!
You're <i>less</i> than livestock!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.080
- Nice to meet you.
- You're worthless nothings!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.750
Now, I'll have you start
by introducing yourselves!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.050
I'm Christa Lenz! Nice to meet you!

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.220
I'm Ymir.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:55.430
If any of you lay a hand on my Christa,
you're dead meat, got that?!

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:58.970
I'm Annie Leonhart from
Wall Maria South Elementary.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.640
I'm Reiner Braun. Nice to meet you.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.810
Next! Who the hell are you?!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.150
Sir!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:10.280
I'm Conny Springer! I'm from Wall Rose
South District's Rakago Elementary!

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.070
You have it backwards, Conny Springer!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.910
Is your heart on your right side?!

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:16.570
Next!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:17.700
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.500
I-I'm Bertholdt Hoover. Nice to meet you.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:21.330
Next!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.370
- I'm Thomas.
- I'm gonna say it. I'm gonna
say that I won't yield to the Titans.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.040
- I'm Mina. Nice to meet you.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:24.870
- I'm Franz. And...

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.250
- I'm Hanna!
- I'm gonna drive them out with all my might!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:26.540
- Eren...
- I'm gonna drive them out with all my might!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.670
- Next!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.090
Yes, sir!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.380
I'm Eren Jaeger from Shiganshina Elementary!

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.510
Why did you enter this junior high?!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.390
In order to drive all the Titans out...

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:42.180
from this school... no, from the entire world!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.400
Hey, Franz.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.860
Hey, he said he'd bring down the Titans.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.030
There's no way that humans can defeat Titans.

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:53.740
What's with them? They're such downers.

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.200
That's not the issue here, Eren.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.370
Geez... Looks like we've
got a weirdo in our class.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:05.540
I don't wanna have anything to do
with bad news, including Titans.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.960
Who're you again?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.380
Jean Kirschtein! I've been
with you since this morning!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.550
Eren, was it? Considering how you are,

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.930
I bet you didn't fit in with
your class in elementary school

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.970
because you creeped people out.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.260
Yeah! So what?!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:20.720
Just FYI, I was a star
player in our soccer club.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.560
<b>Winner
Hahahaha</b>

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.890
On top of that, I did well
in school, so I was very popular.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.890
I got twelve New Year's
greeting cards last year...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:27.690
<b>Hahahaha</b>

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.400
- Well, that's adding in seasons greeting cards.
- What'd you say?!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.060
<b>Ahhhhhhhhhh!
Ambiguous</b>

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.730
I-I can't think of any
specific examples off-hand,

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.320
but I had lots of fun every day!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:34.650
<b>Ahhhhhhhhhh!</b>

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.490
Yeah, I did have fun!

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:39.410
- What's your problem?!
- What's your problem?!

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.120
Stop it.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:50.250
We're in junior high school. You should
try getting along with your classmates.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.340
- What is it?
- Ah! Sorry!

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:53.710
You have very pretty black hair.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.630
Eren, your collar is unbuttoned.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:00.850
Stop it! I'm not your
little brother or your kid!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.720
You bastard! I feel jealous!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:03.560
Huh?!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:08.060
Let go of me! If you pull that hard,
you're gonna tear my uniform!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.110
Hm?

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.820
Hey... What do you think you're doing?

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:22.780
I'm talking to <i>you</i>! Who the hell are you?!

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:26.160
I'm Sasha Braus from Wall Rose South Elementary!

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:31.420
Sasha Braus... What is that you're
holding in your right hand?

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:32.590
A rice ball, sir!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.800
It's got moist wild red salmon belly in it, sir!

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:39.720
Why...? Why did you decide to eat it <i>now</i>?

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.140
I couldn't eat my watermelon this morning,

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:44.310
so I elected to eat it now.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:49.100
No, I don't understand.
<i>Why</i> did you eat the rice ball?

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:56.070
Are you asking me why it's not the
spicy mayo barbecue beef kind, sir?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.070
I want one.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.740
Ah!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.080
Tsk.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.870
Here's half of it for you.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.580
Ha...If?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.380
The entrance ceremony will begin soon.

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:15.590
<b>Attack Junior High School
Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:20.010
Students are expected to come
to the schoolyard with your lunch.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:22.840
- I repeat. Please come to
the schoolyard with your lunch.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.350
- With our lunch?

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:24.550
"Attack Junior High School Entrance Ceremony"

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:25.890
Fall in!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.180
Sir!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:32.520
Attack Junior High's 104th
entrance ceremony begins now!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:36.520
First, we'll have some
words from our headmaster!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.650
- Whoa!
- Why is the ground shaking?!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.240
Ah! What the hell is that?!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.370
<b>Attack Junior High School
Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:47.870
It can't be...!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.960
Th-That wall... is fifty meters high!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.500
It's one of them...

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.630
A Titan!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.050
He...

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:08.180
Don't!

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:13.140
He took something precious away from me!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.440
Eren! You mustn't say it!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.740
Ow!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.030
Titans!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.620
Eren, hurry!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.580
Ahhhhhhhhh!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.630
Huh?

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:38.880
Thomas!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.800
Ahhhh! My <i>gyoza</i> lunch!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.640
My tuna sandwich!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.600
- My salmon lunch!
- So this is how they are...!

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:49.010
Eren!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.470
My omelet!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.100
Mom made me that fried chicken lunch!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.100
- Eren, hurry up! Eren!
- It's happening again, just like that time.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:01.230
They take the things we hold precious from us!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.610
I won't be threatened into submission!

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.740
The target is right in front of me!

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:06.530
Eren!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.700
A Colossal Titan!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.580
This is my opportunity!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:12.080
Eren!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:17.040
For us junior high kids, this single
step will be a great leap forward!

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.760
Go, Eren!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.850
I got him!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.400
Huh?

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:44.900
Ah!

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:46.860
Stop it!

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.820
My precious...

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:52.990
...cheese Hamburg steak lunch!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.670
Cheese Hamburg steak...?

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.460
He laid his life on the line over...

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.500
Over a chee-burg?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.760
Chee-burg bastard.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.220
This is why I told him not to say it.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:11.010
My chee-burg...

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:14.270
Tsk... Damn chee-burg bastard...

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

